    <briefdescription>
<para>Captures diagnostic context for structured error reporting. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used throughout the training module to capture operation-specific context that aids in post-mortem analysis and production troubleshooting.</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_training_diagnostics_1ad5dd515181e4c01390dd8d825f36c8f1" kindref="member">TrainingDiagnostics</ref><sp/>diag;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">diag.operation(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;checkpoint_save&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.input(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;path&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>checkpoint_path)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.input(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;size_bytes&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>file_size)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.add_note(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;attempted<sp/>3<sp/>retries<sp/>on<sp/>ENOSPC&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>CheckpointException(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Failed<sp/>to<sp/>save<sp/>checkpoint:<sp/>disk<sp/>full&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1training_1a989d1a56dd341d79ec9a2e414c64841ba7f4b339a9c5f10f16c93e9e8ace18653" kindref="member">TrainingErrorCode::CHECKPOINT_DISK_SPACE_EXHAUSTED</ref>,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">false</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>not<sp/>recoverable<sp/>without<sp/>operator<sp/>action</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>diag.to_string()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
